# Backend (`apps/backend`)

NestJS API. Stay inside `apps/backend` unless the task needs Prisma or infra.

## Stack

- NestJS 11, TypeScript, Jest, ESLint, Prettier
- Entry: `src/main.ts`, root module: `src/app.module.ts`

## Conventions

- Domain modules under `src/<domain>/` with `*.module.ts`, `*.controller.ts`, `*.service.ts`.
- DTOs and validation next to the controller or in `dto/`.
- Business logic in services, not controllers.
- Tests: `*.spec.ts` next to code; e2e in `test/`.
- Do not edit generated Prisma Client here — schema lives in `apps/prisma`.

## Commands (from `apps/backend`)

```bash
npm run start:dev
npm run lint
npm run test
npm run build
```

